{"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-background-color has-text-color\">我がチーム</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background-color has-foreground-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-1\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:7vw;padding-bottom:7vw\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\" data-attachment-id=\"2213\" data-permalink=\"https://imabi.org/about-us/person_logo/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?fit=360%2C360&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"360,360\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Person_Logo\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?fit=360%2C360&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=360%2C360&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2213\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?w=360&amp;ssl=1 360w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=100%2C100&amp;ssl=1 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-background-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:1.1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">SeTH COONROD</h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">Creator/Author</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">みなさん、こんにちは！My name is Seth Coonrod, and I am an aspiring polyglot whose first love is with the wonderful language of Nihongonese, I mean Japanese. I graduated from the University of Texas at Austin 2015 with my degrees being in linguistics and East Asian Studies. This is where the true magic of IMABI really started. Aside from my love for Japanese, I enjoy other languages such as Korean, and especially Catalan (Barcelonan guys are hot). Outside of languages, I love to raise the heat in my food: kick it up to ghost peppers! I am also a diehard Pokémon trainer extraordinaire. Bringing the focus back to IMABI, I hope everyone is able to understand the innerworkings of Japanese far better than they would otherwise. Be sure to check in here from time to time to see the exciting changes happening here! 以上、よろしくお願いします。</p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\" data-attachment-id=\"2213\" data-permalink=\"https://imabi.org/about-us/person_logo/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?fit=360%2C360&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"360,360\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Person_Logo\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?fit=360%2C360&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=360%2C360&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2213\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?w=360&amp;ssl=1 360w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/imabi.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Person_Logo.jpg?resize=100%2C100&amp;ssl=1 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-background-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:1.1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Taylor V. edwards</h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">Editor</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">Hey there, I’m Taylor V. Edwards! I earned my film degree from Arizona State University in 2022, refining my skills that keep me immersed in the digital storytelling realm. By day I’m knee-deep in the world of technical video editing for “Just Josh Tech”…When the sun sets, I&#8217;m not hitting pause. Instead, I&#8217;m diving into the intricate world of the Japanese language, exploring its nuances one character at a time. But that&#8217;s not all—I&#8217;m also a passionate gamer, navigating virtual worlds and conquering quests in my downtime. Video games are my digital escape, a realm where I find inspiration for both my work and play. So, if you&#8217;re into YouTube tech content, Japanese language exploration, or gaming, you’ve found your person—ready for the next creative adventure with Imabi!</p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n"},"id":2207,"link":"https://imabi.org/about-us/","slug":"about-us","title":{"rendered":"Imabi&#8217;s Little crew"}}
